  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the haricot beans and soak them in water for at least 8 hours.",
    "Drain and rinse the beans, then set them aside.",
    "In a large Korean brass bowl, heat some oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, tomato paste, and shaved bonito flakes, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soaked haricot beans, vegetable broth, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 45 minutes, or until the beans are tender.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with some chopped fresh herbs if desired."
